  "title": "· Balenciaga Le City Moto Bottle Cap Charm Bag ·",
  "original_title": "Balenciaga Le City Moto 瓶盖挂饰手袋",
  "excerpt": "Balenciaga's Winter 25 Le City Moto bag reimagines the classic with a slim shape, detachable straps, and playful bottle-cap charms.",
