      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Balenciaga's Winter 25 collection introduces a new iteration of the iconic City bag — the**Le City Moto**. The new silhouette retains signature design elements like metal studs and leather pull-tabs, while a long, slim 'baguette' shape and two detachable straps (one short, one long) offer versatile styling. A playful array of bottle-cap charms injects a rebellious streetwear edge.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
