      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Volcanic Rock Lambskin ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Crafted from Storico fine-grained lambskin, this supple, glossy leather is covered in fine, crinkled textures that resemble cracked earth or the creases of a well-worn piece — lending it a distinct vintage character.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for an ultra-clear visual experience",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Winter 25 collection takes its cue from**Volcanic Rock**as the primary colorway. The deep gray tone, combined with the crinkled texture, evokes a gritty feel — reminiscent of concrete and cement, with a futuristic, post-industrial vibe.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
