          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Against the volcanic rock backdrop, aged brass-toned studs and zippers add a nostalgic, vintage touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/gori340/7728ef54e181336d.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/gori340/658f517e0bc8e4be.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Bottle-Cap Charms ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag's standout feature is undoubtedly its two pre-attached charm strings. The Balenciaga logo is reimagined as beer-bottle caps, paired with key charms dangling from the bag's clips. The effect is that of an avid bottle-cap collector — the colors and motifs are wildly creative, adding a playful, tongue-in-cheek attitude.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/gori340/8926804b278b94b4.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/gori340/f385f510d82705f0.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Both charm strings are detachable, allowing you to mix and match them on different parts of the bag to suit your outfit.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
