    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Another key feature is the two detachable straps. The short strap measures 20 cm, ideal for hand-carrying or tucking under the arm. The long strap is wide and adjustable, with a 54 cm drop that works for shoulder or crossbody wear — suitable for both men and women.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
