      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/gori340/088a49a89037ac42.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Despite being a small size, the Le City Moto offers surprisingly generous capacity. We managed to fit a phone, a notebook, a wallet, perfume, and earphones — with room to spare. It's surprisingly practical.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
